server.py has been created and tested. All endpoints work as specified:
- GET /health returns 200 with {"status": "ok"}
- POST /sum with valid JSON numbers list returns 200 with {"sum": <sum>}
- POST /sum with invalid JSON or missing/non-list numbers returns 400 with {"error": "..."}
- Any other path returns 404 with {"error": "Not found"}
All responses have Content-Type: application/json.
The server was started on port 8080, tested with curl, and then stopped.
